{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-104916" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Which of the following sets is a subset of $A={{12},{20,22},{6,9,15}}?$\n\n- ${-1,{12}}$\n- ${{20,22}}$\n- ${{0},{6,9,15}}$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14038640/state.json" "file_sha256" "7456475955196ab1459228890db2ba1ddd310af4a542545110235036cdce43e5"} {"question" "q-104916" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "A set is a subset of $A$ if all its elements are elements of $A.$ \n\nWith that in mind, let's inspect each option.\n\n- ${-1,{12}}$ is *not* a subset of $A$ because it contains the element $-1\\notin A.\\,\\times $\n\n- ${{20,22}}$ is a subset of $A.\\,✓$\n\n- ${{0},{6,9,15}}$ is *not* a subset of $A$ because it contains the element ${0}\\notin A.\\,\\times $\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only\"." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14038640/state.json" "file_sha256" "7456475955196ab1459228890db2ba1ddd310af4a542545110235036cdce43e5"} {"question" "q-104916" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14038640/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "5d3e201778a4c3fe75f10c5cc7b701c5453a3e60021b05eb3f9f7bced8a7aad2"} {"question" "q-104916" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14038640/state.json" "file_sha256" "7456475955196ab1459228890db2ba1ddd310af4a542545110235036cdce43e5"} {"question" "q-104916" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["text" "I and III only"] ["text" "I only"] ["text" "II and III only"